160	 *     the difference out of the wallet.
161	 *
162	 * The Checkout session carried the customer's INTENT but never the quoted
163	 * total, so the confirm route re-ran `orderQuote` — including a fresh
164	 * `currentPromo(new Date())` — and debited whatever came back. The card had
165	 * already cleared for the old total's share. The gap came out of the wallet
166	 * with no new consent; with no balance, the payment was captured and no
167	 * server was created.
