67	 * reads the `nxeon_coupon` cookie and grants the bonus, and it refuses when
68	 * NODE_ENV is production or when Stripe is configured. The real card path
69	 * (app/api/stripe/checkout/route.ts -> `creditCheckoutSession`) credits
70	 * `session.amount_total` verbatim, so it cannot add a bonus on top of what was
71	 * charged — no amount of work in this file changes that.
